                "loc": "LUK.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho kaweza kulavya turume, phahi, andareha njiya airi au ana njiya manga airi; mmwenga kpwa ajili ya sadaka ya kuochwa na wanjina kpwa ajili ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi. Mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera mchetu hiye upatanisho kpwa kumuusira najisi, naye andakala swafi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.8"
            ]
          }
